    <h2>Usage guidelines</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Don't recolour the mark or lockup. Use the mono variants when you need a single colour.</li>
        <li>Leave clear space around the mark equal to the height of the lowercase &ldquo;m&rdquo; in
            the wordmark.</li>
        <li>Don't stretch, rotate, or apply effects (drop shadows, outlines, gradients).</li>
        <li>Don't place the mark on a low-contrast background — use the dark variant on dark backgrounds.</li>
        <li>Don't imply endorsement. &ldquo;Built with Muster&rdquo; or &ldquo;Integrates with Muster&rdquo;
            is fine; &ldquo;Muster recommends&rdquo; is not unless we've said so directly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>One-liner</h2>
    <blockquote>
        Muster is a participation-tracking Discord bot — voice attendance, quests, reaction check-ins, and
        multi-currency wallets, all on one leaderboard.
    </blockquote>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Need a quote, screenshot, or interview? Reach us via the <a href="/support">support page</a>.
    </p>
</div>
